# SHELVED 2026-08-29, out of the build. An interface sketch nothing loads: `nullable`, `iterator` and
# `key-value-iterator` were never declared (the unknown-type warning counts them). Delete `note draft` to bring it back.
note draft

form balanced-tree
  head k
  head v

  task clear
    like void

  task copy
    like balanced-tree
      like k
      like v

  task exists
    take key, like k
    like boolean

  task get
    take key, like k
    like nullable, like v

  task iterator
    like iterator, like v

  task key-value-iterator
    like key-value-iterator
      like k
      like v

  task keys
    like iterator, like k

  task remove
    take key, like k
    like boolean

  task set
    take key, like k
    take value, like v
    like void

  task to-string
    like text